{"id":23017,"name":"惊魂夜","rarity":5,"path":"Priest","desc":"丰饶命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"少女躲在门后，不敢再靠前一步。\\n或许是因为今夜的目标就在眼前，她反而有些心跳加速。\\n「不怕不怕，我不怕……」\\n黑暗中，沉默放声尖叫。\\n\\n少女颤抖着，捏紧了手里的「武器」，却依然不敢靠近「目标」。\\n「没什么好害怕…好…好害怕！」\\n\\n身后的尾巴终于忍受不住，骤然亮起。\\n「快点啊，你就是拿个快递而已！」","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23017,"name":"深度深呼吸","desc":"使装备者的能量恢复效率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。我方目标施放终结技时，装备者为当前生命值百分比最低的我方目标回复等同于其<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>生命上限的生命值。当装备者为我方目标提供治疗时，使该目标的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[f1]%</unbreak></color>，该效果最多叠加<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>层，持续<unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak>回合。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.12,0.1,0.024,5,2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.14,0.11,0.027999999,5,2]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.16,0.12,0.032,5,2]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.18,0.13,0.036,5,2]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.2,0.14,0.04,5,2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":52.8,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":113001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":116.16,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110171,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":113001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":200.64,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110172,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":113002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":285.12,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110172,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":113002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":369.6,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110173,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":113003,"Ite